# FinixOS v7.0

Mini Operating System built from scratch in C.

## Features
- Multi-user system with permissions
- Memory management (refcount, slab cache)
- Firewall with rule management
- Network tools (nmap, netstat)
- Package manager (APT wrapper)
- Basic antivirus scanner
- System monitor (CPU, RAM, battery)
- Multi-language (English/Indonesia)
- Crash recovery system
- Games: Tebak Angka, Tic-Tac-Toe
- Prayer reminder

## How to Compile
```bash
gcc -o finixos finixos.c -lm
./finixos
